        "text": "大域: 整数型の配列: hashArray\n\n○論理型: add(整数型: value)\n 整数型: i ← calcHash1(value)\n if (hashArray[i] == -1)\n   hashArray[i] ← value\n   return true\n else\n   i ← calcHash2(value)\n   if (hashArray[i] == -1)\n     hashArray[i] ← value\n     return true\n   endif\n endif\n return false\n\n○整数型: calcHash1(整数型: value)\n return (value mod hashArrayの要素数) + 1\n\n○整数型: calcHash2(整数型: value)\n return ((value + 3) mod hashArrayの要素数) + 1\n\n○test()\n hashArray ← {5個の -1}\n add(3)\n add(18)\n add(11)"
